    {
      "html": "<p class=\"provider-bio\">The Jordan Valley Cancer Center is a purpose-built, two-story facility opened in 2016 and designed around patient comfort. The hospitality-inspired environment replaces the sterile feel of a traditional medical office with natural healing elements of earth, water, and wood. A dual-level fireplace greets patients upon entry, serving as both a comfort and a wayfinding landmark. The clinic houses medical oncology, radiation oncology, infusion therapy, and clinical research under one roof.</p>",
      "title": "About this clinic"
    },
